@startuml stpa_sec_defense_mapping
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

title STPA-Sec 完全突合図 — CA-ADV ↔ UCA-Def ↔ THREAT_MODEL\n(THREAT_MODEL 14 件を制御理論的に再構成)

' ==============================================================
' 左: 敵対者 Controller + CA-ADV (敵対者の制御アクション)
' ==============================================================
package "🦹 Adversary Controllers & CA-ADV" as ADVS #MistyRose {
  card "**CA-ADV.1**\nTCP/8888 接続" as A1
  card "**CA-ADV.2**\nWireshark capture" as A2
  card "**CA-ADV.3**\nARP spoof → MITM" as A3
  card "**CA-ADV.4**\nEvil Twin AP" as A4
  card "**CA-ADV.5**\nTCP DoS spam" as A5
  card "**CA-ADV.6**\nTCP slow read" as A6
  card "**CA-ADV.7**\n2.4GHz Jamming" as A7
  card "**CA-ADV.8**\nMP4 ファイル編集" as A8
  card "**CA-ADV.9**\nプロセスメモリ侵入" as A9
  card "**CA-ADV.10**\ngit clone → cred 取得" as A10
  card "**CA-ADV.11**\nSPI bus → FW 書換" as A11
  card "**CA-ADV.12**\n録画停止操作 (否認)" as A12
  card "**CA-ADV.13**\nmetrics 経由運用情報分析" as A13
}

' ==============================================================
' 中央: UCA-Def (防御 Controller の不在)
' ==============================================================
package "🛡️ UCA-Def (防御 Controller の Not Provided 状態)" as DEFS #LightCyan {
  rectangle "**UCA-AUTH.1**\nクライアント認証 不在\n❌" as U_AUTH #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-CRYPTO.1**\n転送暗号化 不在\n❌" as U_C1 #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-CRYPTO.2**\n保存暗号化 不在\n❌" as U_C2 #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-CRYPTO.3**\nmetrics 暗号化 不在\n❌" as U_C3 #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-INT.1**\n転送 HMAC 不在 (CRC のみ)\n🟡" as U_I1 #LightYellow
  rectangle "**UCA-INT.2**\n録画ハッシュチェーン 不在\n❌" as U_I2 #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-AUDIT.1**\n操作監査ログ 不在\n❌" as U_AU1 #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-AUDIT.2**\n永続障害ログ 不在\n❌" as U_AU2 #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-RL.1**\naccept rate limit 不在\n🟡 BACKLOG=1 のみ" as U_RL1 #LightYellow
  rectangle "**UCA-RL.2**\nslow client 検知 不在\n❌" as U_RL2 #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-APV.1**\nAP MAC 検証 不在\n❌" as U_APV #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-FB.1**\nUSB Tier C 自動切替 不在\n❌" as U_FB #Pink
  rectangle "**UCA-MEMSAFE.1**\n(満たされている)\n✅" as U_MS #LightGreen
  rectangle "**UCA-PHYS.1**\n物理境界 文書化なし\n🟡 暗黙" as U_PH #LightYellow
  rectangle "**UCA-O.2** (運用側)\nWiFi cred を VCS push\n🟡 X-7 計画中" as U_O2 #LightYellow
}

' ==============================================================
' 右: THREAT_MODEL ID + DREAD + STRIDE カテゴリ
' ==============================================================
package "🎯 THREAT_MODEL (DREAD)" as THREATS #LightYellow {
  card "**TS-1** PC viewer なりすまし\nDREAD **46** 🔴" as T_TS1
  card "**TS-2** Evil Twin AP\nDREAD 30 🟡" as T_TS2
  card "**TT-1** MJPEG 中間者改ざん\nDREAD 32 🟡" as T_TT1
  card "**TT-2** MP4 改ざん\nDREAD 34 🟡" as T_TT2
  card "**TR-1** 運用者アクション否認\nDREAD 33 🟡" as T_TR1
  card "**TR-2** 障害発生時否認\nDREAD 33 🟡" as T_TR2
  card "**TI-1** MJPEG 盗聴\nDREAD **48** 🔴" as T_TI1
  card "**TI-2** WiFi cred 漏洩\nDREAD **45** 🔴" as T_TI2
  card "**TI-3** metrics 運用情報漏洩\nDREAD 32 🟡" as T_TI3
  card "**TD-1** TCP DoS spam\nDREAD **42** 🔴" as T_TD1
  card "**TD-2** tx_buff 枯渇 DoS\nDREAD **35** 🔴" as T_TD2
  card "**TD-3** WiFi Jamming\nDREAD 32 🟡" as T_TD3
  card "**TE-1** PC viewer 権限昇格\nDREAD 30 🟡" as T_TE1
  card "**TE-2** Spresense root 化\nDREAD 24 🟢" as T_TE2
}

' ==============================================================
' 推奨対策 M-* (右端)
' ==============================================================
package "💊 推奨対策 (本書 §6, §8.7)" as MIT #LightGreen {
  card "**M-8** TLS-PSK / アプリ層認証\n(Phase 12 Option B/D)" as M8
  card "**M-10** AP MAC 固定" as M10
  card "**M-11** MJPEG HMAC-SHA256" as M11
  card "**M-12** MP4 ハッシュチェーン" as M12
  card "**M-13** GUI 操作監査ログ+署名" as M13
  card "**M-14** 永続ログ (SD) + 署名" as M14
  card "**M-15** rate limit + slow client 検知" as M15
  card "**M-16** USB Tier C 自動切替" as M16
  card "**M-17** 物理境界 運用文書化" as M17
  card "**M-5** pre-commit hook + .example 化\n(X-7)" as M5
}

' ==============================================================
' CA-ADV → UCA-Def (敵対者の CA が成立する条件 = 防御 Def が不在)
' ==============================================================
A1 --> U_AUTH
A2 --> U_C1
A3 --> U_I1
A4 --> U_APV
A5 --> U_RL1
A6 --> U_RL2
A7 --> U_FB
A8 --> U_I2
A8 --> U_C2 : "(盗み見)"
A9 --> U_MS : "(防御済)"
A10 --> U_O2
A11 --> U_PH
A12 --> U_AU1
A13 --> U_C3

' ==============================================================
' UCA-Def → THREAT_MODEL (どの脅威が成立するか)
' ==============================================================
U_AUTH --> T_TS1
U_C1 --> T_TI1
U_C2 --> T_TT2 : "(間接)"
U_C3 --> T_TI3
U_I1 --> T_TT1
U_I2 --> T_TT2
U_AU1 --> T_TR1
U_AU2 --> T_TR2
U_RL1 --> T_TD1
U_RL2 --> T_TD2
U_APV --> T_TS2
U_FB --> T_TD3
U_MS --> T_TE1 : "(✅ Rust で緩和)"
U_PH --> T_TE2
U_O2 --> T_TI2

' TR-2 は内部障害否認のため CA-ADV.12 不要 (CA-AUDIT.2 不在のみで成立)
U_AU2 -[hidden]- T_TR2

' ==============================================================
' THREAT → 推奨対策
' ==============================================================
T_TS1 ..> M8
T_TI1 ..> M8
T_TI3 ..> M8
T_TS2 ..> M10
T_TT1 ..> M11
T_TT2 ..> M12
T_TR1 ..> M13
T_TR2 ..> M14
T_TD1 ..> M15
T_TD2 ..> M15
T_TD3 ..> M16
T_TE2 ..> M17
T_TI2 ..> M5

' ==============================================================
' 観察ノート
' ==============================================================
note bottom of DEFS #LightCyan
  **🛡 STPA-Sec 中核観察**:
  • 防御 Controller 9 種のうち **❌ 完全不在 = 6 (AUTH/CRYPTO×3/INT.2/AUDIT×2/APV/FB)** + **🟡 部分 = 2** + **✅ 達成 = 1 (MEMSAFE)**
  • THREAT_MODEL 14 件中 **12 件が UCA-Def(NP) として一様に説明できる**
  • 残 2 件 (TE-1 / TI-2) は MEMSAFE で防御済 / Operator UCA-O.2 へ委譲
  • SECURITY_GAP_ANALYSIS の「完全乖離」項目 = 防御 Controller が制御構造に物理的に欠落している状態の言い換え
end note

note bottom of MIT #LightGreen
  **📋 Phase 12 セキュリティ判断との対応 (§8.7)**:
  • **Option A** 現状維持 → PHYS のみ実装 (M-17 のみ)
  • **Option B** アプリ層認証 → AUTH + RL (M-8 + M-15)  ← 推奨
  • **Option C** + 完全性 → + INT (M-11, M-12)
  • **Option D** TLS 全面 → + CRYPTO (M-8 拡張)
  • **将来 Phase 13+** → + AUDIT + APV + FB (M-13, M-14, M-10, M-16)
end note

note top of ADVS #MistyRose
  **想定敵対者**:
  • ADV-LAN: WiFi 突破 or LAN 物理侵入後
  • ADV-RF: 2.4GHz 近接
  • ADV-LOCAL: PC 物理ローカル
  • ADV-REPO: リポジトリ閲覧者
  • ADV-PHYS-SPR: Spresense 物理近接

  ※ THREAT_MODEL §1 で「同一 LAN 内」を想定。
  公開インターネット経由は要求書 v1.0 Q24 でスコープ外
end note

@enduml
